<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,476 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,476 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,476 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,473 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			  Nov 14		  Nov 13</p>
<p>Dollar rate	   5,476		   5,473</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
